{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1000_p", "source_sha256": "54fbdf96628952937b9db83349619e144982c3e160f0b68ff9639a57e8abebe1", "ja": "（第八幕の稽古が始まった。重い雰囲気の場面が多い\nストーリーだが、環は元気に取り組んでいる）", "zh": "（第八幕的排练开始了。虽然故事中有很多氛围沉重的场景，但环依然精神饱满地投入其中）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e1d406d1d4a5a8c62142da69fde49bada43d1ef818be007dc3fc430bd89c3af7", "ja": "お疲れ様、環。\nまだ帰らないのか？", "zh": "辛苦了，环。\n还不回去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "d3c4a748ece4141aa28b2f9b923e433d707d341cf2e39f2927b7f2b634d5eefc", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！　ねえねえ、\n『こーりゅー会』って、どんなことすればいいの？", "zh": "啊，大将！那个那个，“交流会”要做些什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d2abc2416a4a59b8a744c7dc93a493480d5379cf90569fa5cee56eb9c669e06e", "ja": "交流会？", "zh": "交流会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "5f87b32ccd022681cadb471c73fb7010604a036357705b230000654ea7a2a1ce", "ja": "うん！\nうみみがね、教えてくれたんだー。", "zh": "嗯！\n是海美告诉我的——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "24f4044eff4d3c9b0303e6c1a37248062b3e38839c2d2dfc03c23123457be104", "ja": "八幕のみんなとは、稽古の間ずっといっしょだから。\nこうりゅう会をして、仲良くするといいよって！", "zh": "因为第八幕的大家在排练期间一直都在一起。\n海美还说，举办交流会、和大家好好相处会比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9296ca3a19d497ed032c67fcaab54a53953c24c27ba0a7d7b9a0cb82d775ac9d", "ja": "ああ。そういえば、海美達もやってたな。", "zh": "啊。说起来，海美她们也这么做过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1007_p", "source_sha256": "715e7a39d399c0fa2f340c86b0823601b20be6153e4c96443c4910f0e8d30f10", "ja": "あの時は、みんなでお菓子を食べながら、\n雑談していたような……。", "zh": "那时候好像是大家一边吃零食，一边闲聊来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1008_040tam", "source_sha256": "a5341b41bbe1a9502ac6c50ec37d77df5ff9dc1b3d504028bc30b7e00fabd413", "ja": "お・か・し・を・た・べ・て、ざ・つ・だ・ん……。\n……ざつだんって何？", "zh": "吃・零・食・聊・天……。\n……“聊天”是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1009_p", "source_sha256": "1e1796cf331fff9f75599112c2f4bbea694f30c8dcebe9e1e33bbd970ae064d6", "ja": "仕事だけでなく、色んな話をするって事かな。\n環なら、学校の事とか、こぶんの事とか。", "zh": "不只是工作，也会聊各种各样的话题吧。\n比如环的话，就聊聊学校里的事，还有小弟们的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "1f374096d6a666aa780a8269048f6c7db170430357f35f98785df35f30a7b8ab", "ja": "……？　たまき、いつも話してるよ？", "zh": "……？ 环不是一直都有在聊天吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1011_p", "source_sha256": "76bf4a2af848e88205bc7ef959a06e693172a11adc1cf2b77471d2352ce8b26c", "ja": "うん、そうだよな……。\n改めて雑談っていうのも難しいか。", "zh": "嗯，也是啊……\n特意要聊闲天，确实也挺难的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7368c8d3af81727840a5f715b0d2cb2641a1ac0a919090cd253e8120242f186f", "ja": "何かテーマを決めると、話しやすいかもしれないな。\n……STARDOM ROADだから、役柄についてとか？", "zh": "要是先定个主题，可能会更容易聊一些。\n……毕竟是STARDOM ROAD，要不要聊聊各自饰演的角色？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1013_040tam", "source_sha256": "6bb83f962844a2528274d1d1b0de22657315d938b77e31947528a0fdca65b2b1", "ja": "おー。たまき、それがいい！\nみんなが織姫のこと、どう思ってるか聞きたい！", "zh": "哦——环觉得这个好！  \n我想听听大家对织姬是什么看法！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "d3b7434ca6a7d937e1ea994dece7e1895cccd21cc6bdd7693e79f02a9f055c30", "ja": "あとね、たまきがみんなをどう思ってるかも、\n聞いてほしいぞ～。くふふ！", "zh": "还有啊，也想听听环对大家是怎么想的。嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1015_p", "source_sha256": "bd3dd79f8ceb683ac94e87d26f87af4030e5d156ce6e06aa34acde28a542d029", "ja": "よし、それでいこう！\n交流会の日にちは、もう決めたのか？", "zh": "好，就这么办吧！\n交流会的日子，已经定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "dc3b291dccfaf2a8335931c8fd085d71da58b8e683b94991eade64b9a296d292", "ja": "ううん、まだ！\nこのあと、みんなに聞こうと思ってるんだ～。", "zh": "还没呢，还没定！\n环打算待会儿去问问大家～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fb5fc7ca7956c642cdf1a712ff978a245af51afded35ec7d30e4974d6b48e057", "ja": "なら、連絡しておくよ。\nみんなの都合がいい日を調整しよう。", "zh": "那我先联系一下吧。\n协调出大家都有空的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1018_040tam", "source_sha256": "6332b9bbce9350b5f9adc54bdf4be66aafca755f977d5034f4e58c50e35ac8d7", "ja": "ありがとう、おやぶん！", "zh": "谢谢你，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0533_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0533_1019_040tam", "source_sha256": "1499ccc585b2417532f88fef173c62141d23e18e404b1fc7a781e347ccd6bb98", "ja": "おやぶんも、絶対参加してね！　だっておやぶんも、\nたまきたちの仲間だもん。約束だぞ～、くふふ♪", "zh": "老大也一定要参加哦！因为老大也是我们这边的伙伴嘛。约好了哦～咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
